y runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February, February to March, April to May and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 35 years. In 2025, July to August came in at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December at 45%. Grid 18772 had its driest year in 2007 at 67%.</p>"}
